	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat060110"},
		line=1382,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The joint Imperial-Republican task force arrives at the base of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"From a distance, it appeared as though the Barrier itself was expelling the black snow into the air, but in fact─",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"All of the black snow is emanating from a single girl suspended between the shattered hemispheres of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kotone?!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What's she doing here?!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Well, well, you sure brought along plenty of company,\ndidn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"From the shadow of the trees, a certain woman makes herself known with a derisive jeer.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Rochel's deputy, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What are you playing at? Explain yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“This here? We call it a karmic wellhead.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“In terms you're familiar with, I suppose you could say it's spewing out the equivalent of hellfire and brimstone?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“At the rate it's working, you might want to say a prayer for the Exalt-Priestess and Tenkyo while you still can.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Sekka turns to look upon the pillar of darkness once more.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"By activating the Barrier, she has reversed the flow of the karmic distortions that fall unremittingly in Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't suppose you'll go ahead and turn it off if we ask nicely?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“As if.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're wasting time talking to her.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Hotori silently draws her blade.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Shiranui's flames roar eagerly to life.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh, you're back to normal.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Right... because Rochel-sama used the Ame no Mikagami...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I couldn't be more glad to see you standing against me.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now I can kill you without reservation.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ehehee! I'll reunite you with your father soon enough.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You'll have all the time in the world to reminisce over what it was like being my slaves.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I see... Father is...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“He was felled in a single blow! By Tokita Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes go wide for a single moment before she closes them softly.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The man you love killed your father.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ahaha, you can't even make it up! Well? How does it feel?!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Hotori receives Sekka's jeers with her eyes peacefully closed.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I couldn't have asked for anything better.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If he really was slain by Soujin, Father surely died without any regrets.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Rather than resent Soujin, I owe him my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"─Knowing him, he surely granted Father a good death.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"That is what Hotori sincerely believes, without any room for doubt.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Rather than grieve for her father, her heart aches for Soujin, left with no choice but to slay his own master.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This conversation is over.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All the pain you inflicted on Father and Soujin, I'll return to you a hundredfold.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Hotori points Shiranui's tip at Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Don't you just say the most hilarious things?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'll freeze you and that fighting spirit of yours where you stand.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Sekka closes her eyes, her lips weaving an unfamiliar invocation.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Black magicks that were interdicted by Himi-no-Mikoto two thousand years ago─",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"A prayer expunged from the Empire's canonical history; a prayer that should never have existed─",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"A wrathful prayer that extols the lord of Ne no Kuni, the keeper of karmic distortions─",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Kuronushi-no-Ookami.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"The very same patron god of Ko no Kuni that House Yagi has unwaveringly served in secrecy for countless generations.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"As such, Sekka's supplication to Kuronushi-no-Ookami allows her to draw on karmic distortions for her power.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Kuronushi-no-Ookami, Thy humble servant beseeches Thee, bestow of me Thy powers Lordly...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"At the completion of her invocation, Sekka rings the prayer bell in her hand with a flourish.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"As though animated by the conductor in an orchestra, the jet-black snow coalesces into a whirling blizzard in the courtyard of the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"The snowstorm eventually splits into countless masses that slowly take on solid form.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Allow me to return the favor for the hospitality Iseya showed me.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"As the wind dies down─",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"One by one, golems of stygian shadow open their eyes.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Each stands over three meters tall, their bodies gleaming with the lustrous sheen of obsidian.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Numbering over one hundred─",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Their presence is nearly enough to blot out any traces of the white sand in the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wh─?!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is this... the work of magicks?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Looks like it.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The Republican soldiers very nearly throw down their weapons and flee at the mere sight of these unfathomable monstrosities.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Even the warriors, well-acquainted with magicks, fail to conceal their unease.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hey, vice governor-general, here's some friendly advice from one former soldier to another: Take your troops and retreat while you still can.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Surely you're not so moronic that you'd sacrifice your own men to protect Imperials?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And I, for one, can't stand the sight of you foreign riff-raff. Kindly remove yourself from my sight at once.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Sekka glares at Elsa with unvarnished contempt.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"To her, the Republicans, ignorant of magicks, are hardly more than savages.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And besides, can't you hear it?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“My puppets have been getting awfully busy, even without my supervision.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“All of Tenkyo must be filled with screams by now.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Unless you run away while you still can, you'll drag the whole Republican Army into this mess.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If your grudge is with the Empire, I'll not abide you harming other peoples!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Kanami raises her voice, but Elsa raises a hand to stop her.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I appreciate the concern, Yagi-san, but I know that well enough without you needing to tell me.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My radio's been ringing off the hook for a while now.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Elsa fixes her gaze firmly on Sekka, smiling faintly.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You probably haven't heard yet, but the nation formerly known as the Empire no longer exists.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As of yesterday, the Empire has been formally annexed into the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh, that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" news to me.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“So the Empire is no more, both in name and in fact? Ahahaha, how delightful! Thanks for making my day!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I wouldn't be celebrating so soon.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republican Army will never abandon its own people.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even if they happened to be citizens of another country only yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republican Army will commit the full extent of its forces to defending the ex-Imperials and defeating all those who threaten their freedom and dignity!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama...!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Everything is just as Elsa planned.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"She pushed forward the annexation bill to protect the Imperials from cruel atrocities like the bombing of Yogarasu District─",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"As well as, when the time came, to be able to mobilize the Republican Army in the name of rescuing its “own” citizens.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"At this very moment, several Republican divisions, acting under direct orders from Elsa, are rushing to the aid of\nTenkyo's residents.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Had she not annexed the Empire, then just as Sekka said, it is entirely possible that the Republican Army would have left the Imperials to die.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Elsa, you have my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“With the number of warriors at our disposal, we never\nwould've been able to protect our people.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We're just acting like any good occupying power ought to.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now then, Yagi Sekka...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How do you like your chances against all sixty thousand Republican soldiers deployed in Tenkyo?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not that I expect you to surrender, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We'll show you some real shock and awe.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"As Elsa raises her right hand, the Republican soldiers train the full firepower of their weaponry on the golems of obsidian.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You'll regret this...”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Open fire!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"The firing line opens up all at once.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Focus your fire and pin the enemy down!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"A withering hail of bullets tears into the golems.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Enough ordnance to reduce a city block into rubble in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san, are your men ready?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Elsa turns to direct her gaze at Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We were born ready.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All forces, prepare to charge!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"At Hotori's command, the warriors all draw their blades as one.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"In the darkness illuminated only by gunfire, their spellblades shimmer with a mesmerizing glow.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hold your fire!”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"The roar of gunfire temporarily ceases─",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Chaaaaarge!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Only to be replaced by the warriors' battle cries as they tear across the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shiranui!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"A blazing dragon of flames devours the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The golems recoil at the heat, and the warriors seize the opening and hack them to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ugh, they sure aren't easy to cut through.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, every creature has a soft underbelly just waiting to be sliced open.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Dodging their clumsy fists of obsidian, Mutsumi deftly fells one golem after another.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"It is said that a master stonemason is capable of splitting a boulder with but a single swing of the chisel.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“See, dear?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Er, that is much easier said than done...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Awawa...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Another golem leaps over, its fists looming ominously over the two─",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hnngh!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Until at the last moment, the enormous heft of a titanic spellblade cleaves it apart.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, Maki-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“This ain't the time for a goddamn lesson!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“If you've got time to talk, you've got time to kill another one of 'em!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Kazuma roars from atop his palanquin.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh dear, we've made the old man terribly cranky.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The fuck you just call me?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Even as they lightly banter among themselves, the warriors never stop moving.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"They nimbly fend off the enemy's onslaught and hack them to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"After felling a considerable number of foes, they all fall back at Hotori's signal.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"The Republican Army, having finished rearming, unleashes another barrage of gunfire upon the golems.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Meanwhile, the warriors take advantage of the lull to regroup and prepare another sortie.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"The first combined-arms battle between the warriors and the Republican Army is working effectively.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The golems of black ice gradually dwindle in numbers until every last one crumbles to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hotori-chan, that was awesome!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey! Don't call me that here.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Inou, splendidly done.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We are very much obliged, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now, all that's left is...”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Elsa and her party all turn their gazes towards Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Couldn't you have held back at least a little?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You're gonna wear me out at this rate...”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Sekka rings the prayer bell once more, and the ruined shards of obsidian scattered across the courtyard rise into the air.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"As though drawn together like lodestones, they reconstitute themselves into dense masses of shadow.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tch... Not again...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"The regenerated monstrosities are far larger than they were before─",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Looming over the Imperial Palace, they stand five meters... ten meters...",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Twenty meters in height.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Each as tall as a high-rise, the colossal golems reawaken with a nightmarish roar.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Nobody utters so much as a gasp.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"The terrible sight before them leaves everyone convinced that they've wandered into a realm of giants─",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"And the dread premonition of imminent tragedy leaves them all at a complete loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Colossus"},
			{
"“─────!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Kahaku has been annihilated by Akari's magicks.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"The sealing was a success.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"The wave of relief washing over me causes me to crumple to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Rushing up to me, Akari lays my head in her lap.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're hurt so badly...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm fine... I'll heal soon enough.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Even before our very eyes, my wounds slowly begin reknitting themselves shut.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Still, it'll be close to ten minutes before I'm able to move again.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“More importantly, what about the seal?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think it worked!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Akari declares with a triumphant smile.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm so glad you don't have to disappear!”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now we can be together for─”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Akari's eyes suddenly go wide.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"I'm unable to believe my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"A hollow gash is running across Akari's chest.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"As though ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"it",
{"/font"},
" is trying to tear apart the vessel that is her body.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari?!”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah... ahh, aaahhh...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Akari stares dumbfounded as a viscous liquid spurts forth from her chest.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Rather than her blood─",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"It's an inklike liquid, darker than pitch.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaaaaaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"As she lets out a tortured scream, the liquid slithers across the ground with a will of its own, coalescing a dozen paces away─",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"In the form of Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari? Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"I lift her limp body in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Despite my panic, however, she is hardly bleeding from the shallow cut across her chest.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"It seems that her wound is not physical in nature.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry... It looks like... I failed...”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sealed him in your own body?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"The way she explained it to me, she was going to make a prison of magicks and lock him away inside.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It was all I could do to make sure it'd succeed...”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But... I still failed...”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How could you─?!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Akari must have kept quiet because she knew I'd try to stop her.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Gotta hand it to you, trying to seal me away was a stroke of genius!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I should have expected as much from the inheritor of\nHimi-no-Mikoto's power, but you sure caught me off guard.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If it weren't for the black snow weakening Miyaguni-san's magicks, I'd have been a goner.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shut up, Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Holding Akari to my chest, I turn to face Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"He stands before us without so much as a scratch on him.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san isn't getting up anytime soon, and you're no match for me.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Looks like this is the end of the line for the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's not over yet!”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"I push through the pain and raise my blade.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Now that the seal has failed, my only option is to take Kahaku down with me.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You're wasting your time.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“No matter how human you are, your weakness makes it all for naught.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“This is where you meet your end, having failed to protect anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Baring his teeth in a wicked leer, Kahaku raises Kakuriyo above his head.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Chill air condenses across his pitch-black spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Its edge grows thick with hoarfrost, as though all the snow falling across the Empire is being gathered in the palm of his hand.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"─This is bad.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"I'm unable to even run, not with Akari still in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Freeze and shatter.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Your three years of futile struggle ends here!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Kahaku lowers his blade, unleashing a roaring torrent of pitch-black snow towards us.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"With me at its center, it envelops all the eye can see.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"As I raise my spellblade against the onslaught of frost, it shatters in my hands like a trinket.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Khh...!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Still holding Akari, I can do nothing but brace myself as the blizzard engulfs us.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"My skin freezes over instantly, large chunks of it scoured from my body by the lashing winds.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"I can feel myself being broken down, piece by piece.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gah! Urgh...”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"The lungful of frozen air I breathe in sears my windpipe, leaving me unable to gasp for breath.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Even wrapped in my arms, Akari's body temperature plummets in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“It was your folly for letting your passions lead you astray.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If you'd only cast aside your heart, you never would have met such an ignoble end.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"As his scornful jeers echo in my ears, my fingertips begin to splinter from the cold.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"And yet, I feel no pain or coldness.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"My nerves have long since frozen over.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"In my stiff arms, Akari's skin goes past the point of deathly paleness, beginning to take on a translucent hue.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"She's freezing to death.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Akari, the sun in my sky is─",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Forgive me... Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Akari lets out a barely audible whisper in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Her beautiful cheeks are being infested by the cold, black frost.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"In no time at all, her fair skin will freeze over and shatter like crystal.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"That is a reality I cannot abide.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Looks like you weren't able to protect your Empire or your princess.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Serves you right for not surrendering your bodies over to Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I'm sure the Imperial people never could've expected that he who cuts down all calamity befalling the Empire would be led astray by lust, of all things!”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...this...”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The people... have nothing... to do with this...”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"I force my shattered throat to move.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ahahahahaha, that's rich!”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The tool created to protect the Empire is forsaking his own people?!”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"In the deepest recesses of my hazy consciousness, I can still see her smile.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" protect you.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where's this coming from all of a sudden?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to protect you. I won't let anyone take away your radiance.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was sudden... But it makes me happy. Really happy.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're seriously offering, I just might take you up on that.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, please grant me this.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"To me, she is the sun in my sky.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Just as the sun has no equal in radiance, Akari is a treasure priceless beyond any measure.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Even the Empire and all its people cannot come close to tipping the scales.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" protect you, Akari.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"The Empire, my friends, my life─I need them not.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll cast it aside... everything... all of it...”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"This is no time to be frozen in place.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"I vowed that I would protect her, of my own free will.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"So stand up─",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"Stand and fight!",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"The vision returns to my frozen eyeballs.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"My shattered limbs restore themselves, flowing anew with fresh blood.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“...Impossible.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"I stand up against the storm of ice.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"The roaring squall buffeting my body, Kahaku's astonished disbelief in my ears─ none of it matters to me.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"─I will protect her.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"My reason, my hesitation, my worldly thoughts are all obliterated by that one single, simple desire.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"All my life, I had believed the domain of “heart and blade in concord” could only be attained once I killed the last of my emotions.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"I believed I would only master the way of the blade once I became a pristine tool that existed only to slay the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"But I was wrong.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"The truth of “heart and blade in concord” is not to cast aside all emotion and become an unthinking tool.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"It is to fill yourself with but one single, pure emotion.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"As a human─",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Only",
{"/font"},
" as a human─capable of giving all of myself over to the dominion of sincere, innocent emotion─ am I able to attain the domain of “heart and blade in concord.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Glad to see you're feeling so motivated, but I'd think twice about taking me on unarmed, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am not unarmed.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"With heart and blade in concord, my heart ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" my blade.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Even should my blade be shattered, my limbs broken, so long as my soul remains pure, I am the farthest thing from being unarmed.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"I shall forge a blade from my very soul to strike down all who set themselves against me.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"─I'll not let this craven tool go on barking any longer.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come forth, my blade.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"I clench my right hand.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"A familiar sensation runs through my fingers.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"When I reopen my eyes, my hand is clasped firmly around a legendary blade.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"Ame no Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"The very same blade that rent apart the legions of Ko no Kuni─a blade born of my very soul.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fuh!”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"The radiant light of the sun emanating from Ame no Mitsurugi dispels the black snowstorm in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Its incandescence is enough even to evaporate all the snow piling up across the hillside.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“...Erasing karmic distortions just like that?!”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin. Prepare yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"I race across the ground.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"The world around me grows dim, as though time itself has slowed.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hwaaaaaaaaaaaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Kahaku swings Kakuriyo down with a roar.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"I easily knock his blade aside, and─",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooraaaaaaaaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"Like a heated wire passing through ice, my divine blade of the sun splits his body atwain.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
